# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Scene hl1-ceiling-fall: hldemo1's scripted start-corridor collapse, the
# "black slab" a playable-ROM check reported when looking up there.
# hldemo_init_mm fires start_ruckus_mm at 30 s (4 s after the intro
# teleport), which fires start_ceiling_fall: func_door_rotating *31 (origin
# brush -2128 392 160 on the corridor's west wall, spawnflags 128 = rotate
# about X: angles (20 0 0)) swings its 160 x 752 x 8 ceiling panel 20
# degrees down (east edge 55 u lower), and toggles its own lights (style 33)
# off while start_spinlights_1 (style 32) comes on. The panel's texture is
# c3a2_ceil (halflife.wad mean RGB 24 31 39), so seen from below it is a
# dark diagonal slab across the corridor. Shots: under the panel's south
# half and from the stair-room end, looking up north / east.
startmap hldemo1
waitmap hldemo1 600
waitnear -2048 744 36 48 60
wait 6
god 1
stats begin
setpos -2048 100 36 -45 90
wait 0.4
shot under_north
wait 0.1
setpos -2048 100 36 -80 90
wait 0.4
shot under_up
wait 0.1
setpos -2048 100 36 -45 0
wait 0.4
shot under_east
wait 0.1
setpos -2048 -100 36 -45 90
wait 0.4
shot stairs_north
wait 0.1
stats end
pass
